  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solidarity Brigades is an exchange project between organisations in Guatemala, Brazil, Colombia and Norway all seeking to develop young leaders&#x2019; technical, organisational and political capacity on a local, national and international level to improve their work for democracy, global justice, sustainable agro-ecological production, autonomy, women and indigenous rights.  Strengthening the unity and solidarity in the struggle for global justice is one of the exchange&#xb4;s expected results.</narrative>
  </description>
